<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>AdonisJS - A fully featured web framework for Node.js</title>
  @entryPointStyles('app')

</head>

<body>

  <main>

    <div
      class=" transform hover:scale-95 transition duration-500   ease-in-out bg-dark rounded-lg shadow-xl p-6 text-center">
      <div class=" flex justify-around  text-center">

        <p class=" font-bold mb-4 text-slate-400  shadow p-2 rounded-lg"> <i class="fas fas-up-arrow"></i>
          €/kw </p>
        <p class=" font-bold mb-4 text-slate-400 shadow p-2 rounded-lg"><i class="fas fas-up"></i> €/kw </p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-emerald-600 text-lg text-bold"> Electrcité</p>
      <p class="text-white bg-emerald-400 text-sm rounded text-center m-2.5 py-2 "> 2023-20-13 07:55</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h1 class="title"> It Works! </h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        Congratulations, you have just created your first AdonisJS app.
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          The route for this page is defined inside <code>start/routes.ts</code> file
        </li>

        <li>
          You can update this page by editing <code>resources/views/welcome.edge</code> file
        </li>

        <li>
          If you run into problems, you can reach us on <a href="https://discord.gg/vDcEjq6?">Discord</a> or the <a
            href="https://forum.adonisjs.com/">Forum</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>

</html>
@entryPointScripts('app')
